      "value": "<p>The beautiful form flickers, and for one instant everyone sees what casts that shadow. Each creature within 6 squares that can see the Angel rolls vs Resolve (DC 18). Fail: 3d10 psychic damage (Stress) and Shaken. Repeat the check at the end of each of its turns to recover. The Angel does not use this ability by choice — the GM may fire it when the Angel drops below half Integrity.</p>",
